    "title": "当 + time clause",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-prepositions-p02-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "当 + time clause",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "当 introduces the time or circumstances in which the main event occurs. It is not the verb meaning serve as in this frame.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "当我到家时，他正在吃饭。",
                "pinyin": "dāng wǒ dào jiā shí ， tā zhèngzài chī fàn 。",
                "meaning": "When I arrived home, he was eating.",
                "audio": "74da529f9db1fc44b2a07605b5cb6c2650a64e03c04901462015a1fcaf9bcbf9"
              },
              {
                "text": "当天气冷的时候，我不出去。",
                "pinyin": "dāng tiānqì lěng de shíhou ， wǒ bù chūqù 。",
                "meaning": "When the weather is cold, I do not go out.",
                "audio": "679d496b09f9031c55b66c96d8c8cb660e40437c1e77e2c57a629d9d81eb05f5"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
